    </stability>
    <license uri="https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT">MIT</license>
    <notes>
v0.2.0 — inline closure capture lands. `function (...) use (...) { ... }` is
now a valid callable for `WaitGroup::go()`; captures are deep-cloned by value
at spawn time (Rust `move` semantics). Rejections: by-reference use, nested
closures, eval-defined closures, bound $this. 14/14 phpt tests on Alpine
(musl) and Debian Bookworm (glibc).
    </notes>
